# Our own infrastructure IPs / CIDRs.
#
# tools/morning_report.py loads this (via `make report` or
# `--our-ips-file tools/our-ips.txt`) to bucket matching source IPs as
# "self-test" instead of "external". Presence here does not justify a
# given query being in the logs — it just lets us identify it fast so
# triage focuses on "not us" traffic.
#
# Copy to tools/our-ips.txt (gitignored) and edit for your environment.
# One IP or CIDR per line; # comments allowed.

